	(text "J01 JST XH (B4B-XH-A) and J02 0.1in header share one pinout:\n  1 GND, 2 V, 3 SDA, 4 SCL\nHDMI DDC cable (channel at 5 V): 1->17 (+20), 2->18, 3->16, 4->15."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 50.8 118 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "6dff328e-edab-4a87-a754-3a4a5ff58e8d")
	)
	(text "Channel voltage (JP01, 3-pin header + shunt):\n  1-2 = 3.3 V   2-3 = 5 V   none = channel unpowered, no pull-ups.\nPull-ups and the connector's V pin both follow JP01.\nJP02 (bridged): cut to remove the 2.2k pull-ups for devices that bring their own.\nF01 limits connector V current; D01 clamps SD/SC/V against ESD."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 50.8 25.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "c148c102-01d9-4667-bf41-69d3eec7e6b5")
	)
